            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "05 Soraya's Idle Talk Test (For Bao'er)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2200607",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220060701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220060701": {
            "id": "220060701",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Fortunately, the jade plate is undamaged.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220060703",
              "220060707"
            ]
          },
          "220060703": {
            "id": "220060703",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "A relic should be for scholars to study, for artists to take inspiration from, for people to admire in an exhibition...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220060704"
            ]
          },
          "220060704": {
            "id": "220060704",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "It must never be given to thieves to sell for petty cash. As well as dishonoring a precious relic, it's trampling all over history.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220060705"
            ]
          },
          "220060705": {
            "id": "220060705",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "I refuse to back down before people who treat history, and its relics, like trash."
          },
          "220060707": {
            "id": "220060707",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Oh, it's piqued your interest, has it? Well answer me this — are you interested in its cultural value, or its monetary value?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220060708"
            ]
          },
          "220060708": {
            "id": "220060708",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "I'm joking. This jade plate records an event from the Archon War — a clash of clans, if I'm not mistaken.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220060709"
            ]
          },
          "220060709": {
            "id": "220060709",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "If I can decipher it, maybe I can fill in some of the gaps in Sumeru Akademiya's records.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220060710"
            ]
          },
          "220060710": {
            "id": "220060710",
            "speakerId": 1612,
            "speakerName": "Soraya",
            "text": "Or maybe those gaps have been filled in already, I'm just not allowed to know about them..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}